---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Monkey Bomb Tag Guide" description="About the Monkey Bomb Tag Guide — a fan-made companion site for the Roblox game." path="/about/">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold mb-4">About Monkey Bomb Tag Guide</h1>
  <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-4">
    <p><strong>Monkey Bomb Tag Guide &amp; Tools</strong> is a fan-made companion site for the Roblox game Monkey Bomb Tag. We are <strong>not affiliated with</strong> Roblox Corporation, Crazay Games, or Syn.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">What We Provide</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
      <li><strong>Verified codes</strong> — tested and confirmed working</li>
      <li><strong>Calculators</strong> — case drop rates, banana earnings, survival odds</li>
      <li><strong>Bomb timer</strong> — practice tool to improve reaction time</li>
      <li><strong>Tier lists</strong> — cases, tails and items ranked by value</li>
      <li><strong>Guides</strong> — beginner tips, farming strategies, advanced tactics</li>
      <li><strong>Complete wiki</strong> — maps, modes, cosmetics and game mechanics</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Data Sources</h2>
    <p>All game data is collected from:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
      <li>In-game gameplay and observation</li>
      <li>Official developer announcements and social media</li>
      <li>Community Discord server</li>
      <li>Public Roblox game information</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Update Frequency</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
      <li><strong>Codes:</strong> Checked regularly, updated within hours of new code releases</li>
      <li><strong>Game data:</strong> Updated after each game patch</li>
      <li><strong>Stats:</strong> Last checked date shown on homepage</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Corrections</h2>
    <p>Found incorrect data or outdated information? <a href="/contact/" class="text-green-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Contact us</a> and we'll fix it as soon as possible.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
